**Postmortems (PM-NNNN)** are detailed technical retrospectives — they are generated as `.md` files in `sdlc/postmortems/` and written directly. No paste-in or copy-out needed.

**All other artifacts** (DESIGN, PLAN, TEST-PLAN, SEC, OBS, IMPL-REVIEW, RELEASE-PLAN, RELEASE-NOTES, PM) are generated as `.md` files in `sdlc/` and read/written directly. No paste-in or copy-out is needed for these.
